== 2. n = 1 (NLO): 2F1(eps,1-eps;1-eps;-x) (1+x)^eps = 1
1
== 3. NNLO variable y: u = (y+z-y z)/(1-y+y z)  =>  (u-z)(1-u z)/(1+u)^2 = y(1-y)(1-z)^2
-((-1 + y)*y*(-1 + z)^2)
   and 1+u = (1 + z)/(1 - y + y*z),  u - z = -((y*(-1 + z)*(1 + z))/(1 - y + y*z)),  1 - u z = ((-1 + y)*(-1 + z)*(1 + z))/(1 - y + y*z)
